Sources for the `migration-planner` agent (see plans/skill-audits/migration-planner.md for the full audit):

- void-harness `migrations-safety` skill — the zero-downtime, two-phase, batched-backfill discipline the agent sequences into a plan (the skill prescribes safety; the agent produces the ordered, reversible plan).
- Expand-contract / parallel-change pattern — Martin Fowler, "ParallelChange" https://martinfowler.com/bliki/ParallelChange.html — the reversible-step backbone of the plan.
- void-harness `writing-plans` skill — the executable-plan shape the agent emits (handed off for execution, which the agent does not perform).

Strategy: original (compose). Planning only, never execution: sequenced, reversible (expand-contract) migration plan. Routes execution to tdd/writing-plans. model: opus (sequencing/reasoning).
